{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：纵向交替的话与感受需要不断上下切换，快速扫读不如X左右分栏直接；尤其部分段落，感受提示较密，容易打断叙事阅读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让叙事和音乐感受各有位置，扫一眼比较容易建立整体印象，但长句没有突出的视觉抓手。Y通过关键词加亮，让每段的心理重点更容易被捕捉，而且人物的矛盾、回忆、孤独、重新理解自己直到最终决定，因果和情绪转折交代得更充分。尤其是与具体音乐时刻对应的感受提示，让情绪变化不只是笼统的悲伤或振奋，而有了细腻的层次、动作和声音质感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fd1d481e-2d37-4d49-b22f-79b70729dfb6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T165143899320Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:53:07.018081+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "97313116054fe96e20eb4c21590cabcb00f70c4083042f20a420cd26569f2094", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme